      <card icon="sparkles" title="Lucide icons built-in">1500+ beautiful icons via CDN. Just write icon="zap" and they appear.</card>
      <card icon="file-text" title="Markdown first-class">Drop md blocks anywhere. Full CommonMark support ready.</card>
      <card icon="blocks" title="Ready components">Navbar, hero, cards, grids, counters, buttons and more — all theme-aware.</card>
