  <section title="Get started in 30 seconds">
    <md>
### 1. Run the CLI

    node bin/stk.js dev examples/landing.stk

### 2. Scaffold a new project

    node bin/stk.js init my-site

### 3. Build for production

    node bin/stk.js build index.stk -o dist
    </md>
  </section>

  <section title="Deploy to Vercel">
    <md>
**CLI**

    node bin/stk.js build index.stk -o public
    npx vercel --prod

**GitHub**

1. Push repo.
2. Import on vercel.com.
3. Build Command: node bin/stk.js build index.stk -o public
4. Output Directory: public
